Z||000007||artherd||08-14-2001||06:30 AM||||Tried to snap a pic today, but couldn't get a good shot with the wheel on (and didn't get a chance to pop it off)<P>Expect pic soon, you'll go "oh yeah, that thingie! " :)<P>PS: while I don't think it will cause any abnormal wear (and infact I think if anything the bushings will simply last longer) do realize that I am treating the car with the mindset of "well, in 6months it will recive a northstar with solid mounting anyway, so what :)<P>ok, now I've covered my hindquarters (they were getting cold)<P>Best!~<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
